    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2SXkQr5Fvq2bqdPfkbgRFUe)_\n\n## Summary\n- `sp-posframe-enabled` now defaults to `nil`: a fresh start has no posframe.\n- `sp-posframe-toggle` is unchanged and still works for a session.\n- The centered miniframe is marked as on the backburner in the module commentary and docstring (nothing deleted).\n- `docs/tangles/ui/sp-posframe.org` starts with an archived status banner; the `README.org` module table entry is marked archived.\n- New ADR `adr/0027-centered-miniframe-on-the-backburner.org`, linked from `adr/README.org`.\n- The `.org` and tangled `.el` are kept in sync. No CHANGELOG edit (nightly tidy).\n\n## Manual testing\n- [x] Pull this branch, restart Emacs (untested by Claude)\n- [x] Fresh start: `M-x` shows the minibuffer at the bottom of the frame, no centered posframe (untested by Claude)\n- [x] `M-x sp-posframe-toggle`: message \"Minibuffer posframe on\", next `M-x` is centered (untested by Claude)\n- [x] `M-x sp-posframe-toggle` again: message \"off\", minibuffer back at the bottom (untested by Claude)\n- [x] Edge case: `C-x C-f` and a citar prompt work normally with the posframe off (untested by Claude)\n- [ ] Regression: typing in `M-x` shows no glitching and no stray `*Minibuf-1*` window (untested by Claude)\n- [x] Open `docs/tangles/ui/sp-posframe.org`: the banner and ADR 0027 link render and resolve\n- [ ] Check the README module table row and `adr/README.org` row for 0027\n\nBranch note: this branch is `claude/project-thread-izq57x` because the session can only push there; it cannot carry the PR-number prefix. Please rename or retarget if needed.\n\n<details><summary>Revert after testing</summary>\n\n- Discard local edits: `git -C ~/dotfiles status`, then `git -C ~/dotfiles restore .` (`git clean -fd` only after `git clean -nd`).\n- Return to main: `git -C ~/dotfiles switch main` and `git -C ~/dotfiles pull`.\n- Optionally delete the test branch: `git -C ~/dotfiles branch -D claude/project-thread-izq57x`.\n- Restart Emacs (or `M-x sp-reload-modules`) so the config matches main.\n</details>\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiD2n6SyCzEyHKthiaG)_",
